OL,3,GNEWSASchool offers prizes to pupils for
OL,4,Aturning up to class on day GTA 6 comes
OL,5,Aout
OL,6,
OL,7,FA school concerned about pupils coming
OL,8,Fin on the day the highly-anticipated
OL,9,FGTA VI video game is released has
OL,10,Foffered young people prizes for turning
OL,11,Fup for classes.
OL,13,FBelfast Boys' Model school issued
OL,14,Fletters to parents, saying that the
OL,15,Frelease of the game on Thursday
OL,16,Fcoincided with GCSE maths exams.
OL,18,FThe school said that "activities such
OL,19,Fas playing Grand Theft Auto can wait
OL,20,Funtil the weekend".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
