OL,3,GNEWSASchool offers prizes to pupils for
OL,4,Aturning up to class on day GTA 6 comes
OL,5,Aout
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Monday, the school added that pupils
OL,8,Fwho attended school on both Thursday
OL,9,Fand Friday would be entered into a draw
OL,10,Ffor a #70 gift card for either
OL,11,FPlayStation or Xbox.
